# === NODE: Set the priority and note the score ===
# With confirm true: raises the priority when the score calls for it (never lowers it, and never sets
# critical), emails the dispatcher about a possible P1 through Postmark (an internal note says so when
# Postmark isn't set up), and adds one internal note with the score breakdown. A preview (confirm
# false) changes nothing and returns the plan. The note carries a marker, so a rerun or a ServiceAI
# Retry neither changes the priority again nor emails the dispatcher twice.
# >>> _shared/psa.ps1 (generated by _shared/inject.js; edit the source, not this block)
# <<< _shared/psa.ps1
